            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-0561",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "libtiff: Denial of Service via crafted TIFF file"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Null source pointer passed as an argument to memcpy() function within TIFFFetchStripThing() in tif_dirread.c in libtiff versions from 3.9.0 to 4.3.0 could lead to Denial of Service via crafted TIFF file. For users that compile libtiff from sources, the fix is available with commit eecb0712."
